<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <!-- Cookiebot cookie consent script: Banner script -->
    <script defer id="Cookiebot" src="https://consent.cookiebot.com/uc.js" data-cbid="7819dc9c-01f3-4d09-a8dc-b26fa39e69c0" data-blockingmode="auto" type="text/javascript"></script>

    <!-- META -->
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width">
    <meta name="author" content="WebPerformance Report">
    <meta name="description" content="Google Analytics 4 report in your inbox, daily, weekly or monthly. Reports, Decisions, Results...">
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
    <meta property="og:title" content="Google Analytics 4 Report | WebPerformance Report">
    <meta property="og:description" content="Google Analytics 4 report in your inbox, daily, weekly or monthly. Acquisition, engagement, top pages and audience, summarised and compared with the previous period.">
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://webperformancereport.com/assets/img/webperformance-report-google-analytics-ga4.png">
    <meta property="og:image:alt" content="Google Analytics 4 Report | WebPerformance Report">
    <meta property="og:locale" content="en_GB">
    <meta property="og:type" content="website">
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://webperformancereport.com/ga4/">

    <!-- TWITTER CARD -->
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <meta name="twitter:site" content="@webperfreport" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="Google Analytics 4 Report | WebPerformance Report" />
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="Google Analytics 4 report in your inbox, daily, weekly or monthly. Acquisition, engagement, top pages and audience, summarised and compared with the previous period." />
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://webperformancereport.com/assets/img/webperformance-report-google-analytics-ga4.png" />

    <!-- SPEED -->

    <!-- LINK -->
    <link rel="canonical" href="{{ site.url }}{{ page.url }}">
    <link rel="icon" href="{{ '/' | url }}favicon.ico">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="{{ '/' | url }}apple-touch-icon.png">

    <!-- PERFORMANCE -->
    <link rel="preload" as="image" href="/assets/img/ga4/google-analytics-ga4-hero-image.png?20260927">

    <style>
    /* inter-regular - latin */
    @font-face {
      font-display: swap; /* Check https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/@font-face/font-display for other options. */
      font-family: 'Inter';
      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 400;
      src: url('{{ "/" | url }}fonts/inter-v12-latin-regular.woff2') format('woff2'), /* Chrome 36+, Opera 23+, Firefox 39+ */
          url('{{ "/" | url }}fonts/inter-v12-latin-regular.woff') format('woff'); /* Chrome 5+, Firefox 3.6+, IE 9+, Safari 5.1+ */
    }

    /* inter-700 - latin */
    @font-face {
      font-display: swap; /* Check https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/@font-face/font-display for other options. */
      font-family: 'Inter';
      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 700;
      src: url('{{ "/" | url }}fonts/inter-v12-latin-700.woff2') format('woff2'), /* Chrome 36+, Opera 23+, Firefox 39+ */
          url('{{ "/" | url }}fonts/inter-v12-latin-700.woff') format('woff'); /* Chrome 5+, Firefox 3.6+, IE 9+, Safari 5.1+ */
    }
    </style>

    <link rel="preload" as="style" href="{{ '/' | url }}style.css?20261003">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ '/' | url }}style.css?20261003">

    <!-- TITLE -->
    <title>{{ title }}</title>
  </head>
  <body class="{{ pageClass }}">
    {% include "layouts/shared/launch-bar.njk" %}
    <header role="banner" class="ui-section-header">
      <div class="ui-layout-container">
        <div class="ui-section-header__layout ui-layout-flex">
          <!-- LOGO -->
          <a href="{{ '/' | url }}" role="link" class="ui-section-header--logo">
            <img src="{{ '/' | url }}assets/img/webperformance-report-logo.png" width="100" height="100" alt="WebPerformance Report" class="">
          </a>
          <!-- HAMBURGER -->
          <input type="checkbox" id="ui-section-header--menu-id">
          <label for="ui-section-header--menu-id" class="ui-section-header--menu-icon"></label>
          <!-- MENU -->
          <nav role="navigation" class="ui-section-header--nav ui-layout-flex">
            <a href="{{ '/' | url }}ga4/#Subscribe" role="link" aria-label="Subscribe" class="ui-section-header--nav-link ui-section-header--nav-link-subscribe">Subscribe</a>
            <a href="{{ '/' | url }}ga4/#About" role="link" aria-label="About" class="ui-section-header--nav-link">About</a>
            <a href="{{ '/' | url }}ga4/#Catalog" role="link" aria-label="Catalog" class="ui-section-header--nav-link">Catalog</a>
            <a href="{{ '/' | url }}ga4/#Report" role="link" aria-label="Report" class="ui-section-header--nav-link">Report</a>
            <a href="{{ '/' | url }}plans/" role="link" aria-label="Plans" class="ui-section-header--nav-link ui-section-header--nav-link-featured ui-section-header--nav-link-first">Plans</a>
            <a href="{{ '/' | url }}ga4/#Contact" role="link" aria-label="Contact" class="ui-section-header--nav-link">Contact</a>
            <a href="{{ '/' | url }}ga4/#Subscribe" role="link" aria-label="Subscribe Free" class="ui-section-header--nav-cta">Subscribe Free</a>
            <a href="https://board.webperformancereport.com/" rel="noopener" target="_blank" role="link" aria-label="Your Board" class="ui-section-header--nav-board"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3h4a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v12a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-4"/><path d="M8 14l4-4-4-4"/><path d="M12 10H3"/></svg><span>Your Board</span></a>
                      <p class="ui-section-header--nav-note">Free plan: 4 reports a month, no card required.</p>
          </nav>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>
    <main role="main">
      <section class="ui-section-hero ui-section-hero--commercial">
        <div class="ui-layout-container">
          <div class="ui-section-hero__layout ui-layout-grid ui-layout-grid-2">
            <!-- COPYWRITING -->
            <div>
              <p class="ui-section-hero--eyebrow">Reports. Decisions. Results.</p>
              <h1><span style="font-size: 2.4rem; color: #fff;">Google Analytics 4 </span> <span style="font-size: 3.10rem;">Report</span></h1>
              <p class="ui-text-intro ui-section-hero--lead">Web analytics report delivered directly to your inbox.</p>
              <p class="ui-text-intro">Know what is growing your traffic and what is slipping: see how your audience, channels and pages compare with the previous period, and where to focus next.</p>
              <!-- CTA -->
              <div class="ui-component-cta ui-layout-flex">
                <div class="ui-section-hero--actions">
                  <a href="#Subscribe" role="link" aria-label="Get the Report" class="ui-component-button ui-component-button-normal ui-component-button-primary">Get the Report</a>
                  <a href="{{ '/' | url }}plans/" role="link" aria-label="See Plans" class="ui-component-button ui-component-button-normal ui-component-button-ghost">See Plans</a>
                </div>
                <p class="ui-text-note ui-section-hero--trust">
                  <small>Available from the Lite plan. Set up from your Board.</small>
                  <small><strong>Built on top of <a href="https://marketingplatform.google.com/about/analytics/?utm_source=webperfreport&utm_medium=website" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google Analytics 4</a></strong></small>
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- IMAGE -->
            <img src="{{ '/' | url }}assets/img/ga4/google-analytics-ga4-hero-image.png?20260927" width="512" height="468" fetchpriority="high" alt="Google Analytics 4 report showing active users, new users, sessions and views with their change against the previous period, and the desktop and mobile split" class="ui-image-half-right">
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="ui-section-sponsor-strip">
        <a name="Sponsors"></a>
        <div class="ui-layout-container">
          <div class="ui-section-sponsor-strip__layout">
            <p class="ui-section-sponsor-strip--label">Sponsored <span class="ui-section-sponsor-strip--label-soft">by</span></p>
            <a href="https://www.catchpoint.com/?utm_source=webperfreport&utm_medium=website&utm_campaign=sponsors" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img src="{{ '/' | url }}assets/img/sponsors/sponsor-logo-catchpoint-webpagetest.png" loading="lazy" alt="Catchpoint WebPageTest" width="200" height="71" class="ui-section-sponsor-strip--logo"></a>
            <span class="ui-section-sponsor-strip--divider" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <p class="ui-section-sponsor-strip--trust">Trusted by teams at Google, Airbnb, Stripe, IKEA, Nestlé and dozens more global brands.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="ui-section-title">
        <div class="ui-layout-container">
          <h2>{{ mainTitle }}</h2><a name="Subscribe"></a>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="ui-section-subscribe">
        <div class="ui-layout-container">
          {% block pagemaincontent %}
          {% endblock %}
        </div>
      </section>
      {% block shared_content_testimonials %}
      {% endblock %}
      <section class="ui-section-title">
        <div class="ui-layout-container">
          <h2>About Analytics Report</h2><a name="About"></a>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="ui-section-about">
        <div class="ui-layout-container">
          <div class="ui-section-about__cards">
            <!-- THE PRODUCT: the same first paragraph on every report page -->
            <div class="ui-section-about__card ui-section-about__card--product">
              <h3 class="ui-section-about__title">About WebPerformance Report</h3>
              <p>WebPerformance Report is a reporting service. It gathers data from the tools you already trust and turns it into a clear report delivered to your inbox, on your schedule. Free to start, no dashboard to keep checking.</p>
              <p><strong>The Google Analytics 4 Report</strong> shows the numbers from your GA4 property next to the previous period: audience and traffic, device category, countries, acquisition channels and top pages, so a drop shows up while you can still act on it.</p>
              <a href="https://webperformancereport.com/report/ga4/" rel="noopener" target="_blank" class="ui-component-button ui-component-button-normal ui-section-about__button">See the analytics report</a>
            </div>
            <!-- THE SOURCE: the tool behind this page's report -->
            <div class="ui-section-about__card ui-section-about__card--source">
              <h3 class="ui-section-about__title">Where the data comes from</h3>
              <a href="https://marketingplatform.google.com/about/analytics/?utm_source=webperfreport&utm_medium=website&utm_campaign=about" rel="noopener" target="_blank" class="ui-section-about__logo ui-section-about__logo--square"><img alt="Google Analytics 4" width="200" height="204" loading="lazy" src="{{ '/' | url }}assets/img/catalog/google-analytics-ga4.png"></a>
              <p>Google Analytics is the most widely used analytics platform on the web, and for most teams it is where their traffic numbers come from. GA4 is its current generation, built on an event-based model that measures websites and apps together.</p>
              <p>The standard version is free and connects with Google Ads, Search Console and BigQuery.</p>
              <a href="https://marketingplatform.google.com/about/analytics/?utm_source=webperfreport&utm_medium=website&utm_campaign=about" rel="noopener" target="_blank" class="ui-component-button ui-component-button-normal ui-section-about__button">Explore Google Analytics 4</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      {% include "layouts/shared/users.njk" %}
      {% block shared_content_catalog %}
      {% endblock %}
      <section class="ui-section-title">
        <div class="ui-layout-container">
          <h2>Inside the Web Analytics Report</h2><a name="Report"></a>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="ui-section-inside">
        <div class="ui-layout-container">
          <p class="ui-text-intro ui-section-inside__intro">A traffic drop rarely announces itself: a channel dries up, a market cools or a page loses its audience, and it can take weeks before anyone notices. Every report shows your numbers next to the previous period across the five areas below, so you can see what moved and where to look first.</p>
          <ul class="ui-section-inside__cards">
            <li class="ui-section-inside__card">
              <h3 class="ui-section-inside__title">Summary</h3>
              <p>Active users, new users, sessions and views, each with the change against the previous period.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="ui-section-inside__card">
              <h3 class="ui-section-inside__title">Device category</h3>
              <p>How your audience splits between desktop and mobile, and whether one is growing while the other falls.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="ui-section-inside__card">
              <h3 class="ui-section-inside__title">Country</h3>
              <p>Where your visitors are, with users, sessions and views per country, so you can see which markets are growing.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="ui-section-inside__card">
              <h3 class="ui-section-inside__title">Channel</h3>
              <p>Which channels bring people in, direct, referral, organic search and more, and which ones are slipping.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="ui-section-inside__card">
              <h3 class="ui-section-inside__title">Pages</h3>
              <p>Your top pages by users, sessions and views, so you can tell which content is working and which is losing its audience.</p>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://webperformancereport.com/report/ga4/" rel="noopener" target="_blank" class="ui-component-button ui-component-button-normal ui-component-button-primary ui-section-inside__button">See a full analytics report</a>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="ui-section-title">
        <div class="ui-layout-container">
          <h2>Contact</h2><a name="Contact"></a>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="ui-section-close">
        <div class="ui-layout-container">
          <p>Get in touch: <a href="mailto: info@webperformancereport.com">info@webperformancereport.com</a></p>
		      <p><a href="https://www.producthunt.com/products/WebPerformance-Report" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="https://api.producthunt.com/widgets/embed-image/v1/review.svg?post_id=297274&theme=light" alt="WebPerformance Report - Web page performance test every week in your inbox.  | Product Hunt" style="width: 250px; height: 54px;" width="250" height="54"  /></a></p>
          <address>
            <strong>WebPerformance Report</strong><br>
            Reports. Decisions. Results.
            <br>
            <small>(stable version 😊)</small>
          </address>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    {% block shared_content_footer %}
    {% endblock %}
  </body>
</html>
